WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: fr

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:03.980
-Vor der kaserne,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.720
..vor dem grossen tor.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.480
Stand eine laterne..

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.480
..und steht sie noch davor.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.420
So wollen wir
uns da wiedersehen.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.460
Bei der laterne..

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.240
..wollen wir stehen.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:28.180
Wie einst Lili Marleen.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:33.280
Wie einst Lili Marleen.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.160
...

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:40.460
Et dans la nuit sombre,

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:43.200
..nos corps enlacés..

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:45.780
..ne faisaient qu'une ombre..

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.800
..lorsque je t'embrassais.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:53.660
Nous échangions ingénument,

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:56.600
..joue contre joue..

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.580
..bien des serments.

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:04.160
Tous deux, Lili Marleen.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:09.280
Tous deux, Lili Marleen.

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:14.120
Le temps passe vite..

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.040
..lorsque l'on est deux.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:21.840
Helas, on se quitte,
voici le couvre-feu.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:27.200
Te souviens-tu de nos regrets..

00:01:28.020 --> 00:01:32.500
..lorsqu'il fallait nous séparer ?

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:37.000
Dis-moi, Lili Marleen.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:42.540
Dis-moi, Lili Marleen.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:52.800
...

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:59.560
I knew you were waiting
in the street.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:02.240
I heard your feet,

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.400
..but could not meet.

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:09.520
My own Lili Marleen.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:15.420
My own Lili Marleen.

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:19.600
Cette tendre histoire..

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:22.260
..de nos chers 20 ans..

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:24.680
..chante en ma mémoire..

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.660
..malgré les jours, les ans.

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:32.240
Il me semble entendre ton pas..

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:35.100
..et je te serre..

00:02:35.740 --> 00:02:37.920
..entre mes bras.

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:43.960
Lili... Lili Marleen.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:50.160
Lili... Lili Marleen.

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:57.200
...

